#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-p9.rst:5 278f87d47c384e60b87fead63a967036
msgid "CUAV P9 Radio"
msgstr "CUAV P9 电台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-p9.rst:10 ff89ab16ce7f456a8b0d1d5a96d1b229
msgid ""
"P9 Radio is a long-range drone telemetry module developed by CUAV. It has "
"high power, high speed and high receiving sensitivity, which is very "
"suitable for UAV communication system."
msgstr "P9 电台是 CUAV 开发的长距离无人机数传模块。具有高功率、高速率和高接收灵敏度，非常适合无人机通信系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-p9.rst:14 5baf0af86a764a429e62cf9785d9302c
msgid "Key Features"
msgstr "主要特性"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-p9.rst:16 68221ddbbb4849f6823242e97c9c1493
msgid ""
"Up to 60KM long-distance transmission.（depending on the antenna and use "
"environment)."
msgstr "最远 60KM 远距离传输（取决于天线和使用环境）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-p9.rst:17 c63a0cea81d5433fa380a65d1f55553a
msgid "902-928 MHz Working frequency"
msgstr "902-928 MHz 工作频率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-p9.rst:18 31f9a0f8d2014960923f8a4d2aaa558d
msgid ""
"Support point-to-point, point-to-multipoint, relay communication and other "
"communication methods."
msgstr "支持点对点、点对多点、中继通信等多种通信方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-p9.rst:19 73bca417c8f94e8697623fedc570e52e
msgid "1 Watt (+30dBm) transmit power."
msgstr "1 瓦（+30dBm）发射功率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-p9.rst:20 5cb61bfbf97a4ad5a21d9f1c7b52e189
msgid "Supports 12v~60V operating voltage."
msgstr "支持 12V~60V 工作电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-p9.rst:21 f91b2057c85445148e881beed7f28e39
msgid "Support high-speed frequency hopping technology, anti-interference."
msgstr "支持高速跳频技术，抗干扰能力强。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-p9.rst:25 22dcb23fce784749b37f87eb6962822d
