"<https://cuav.en.alibaba.com/product/1600096553670-821011610/Free_shipping_CUAV_New_design_P9_Radio_Telemetry_Ground_end_package_for_FPV_Data_Transmission_Station.html?spm=a2700.shop_index.152.3.5b1879959A5ANe>`__."
msgstr ""
"从 `CUAV 商店 <https://store.cuav.net/shop/p9/>`__ 订购，或从 `此处 "
"<https://cuav.en.alibaba.com/product/1600096553670-821011610/Free_shipping_CUAV_New_design_P9_Radio_Telemetry_Ground_end_package_for_FPV_Data_Transmission_Station.html?spm=a2700.shop_index.152.3.5b1879959A5ANe>`__"
